### Promotion Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = <replace with actual admin token>

### 1. Get All Active Promotions
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions

### 2. Get Applicable Promotions (Active & Within Date Range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions/applicable

### 3. Get Single Promotion
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions/{{promotionId}}

### 4. Validate Promo Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "SUMMER20",
  "total_amount": 500000
}

### 5. Validate Invalid Promo Code (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "INVALID999",
  "total_amount": 500000
}

### 6. Validate Expired Promo Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "EXPIRED20",
  "total_amount": 500000
}

### 7. Create New Percentage Promotion
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "NEWSEASON{{$timestamp}}",
  "discount_value": 25,
  "discount_type": "percentage",
  "start_date": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(30, 'd') iso8601}}",
  "description": "New Season Discount",
  "is_active": true
}

### 8. Create Fixed Amount Promotion
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "FIXED100K",
  "discount_value": 100000,
  "discount_type": "fixed",
  "start_date": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(60, 'd') iso8601}}",
  "description": "Fixed 100k discount",
  "is_active": true,
  "min_purchase": 500000
}

### 9. Create Promotion - Invalid Discount Type (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "INVALID",
  "discount_value": 30,
  "discount_type": "invalid_type",
  "start_date": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(30, 'd') iso8601}}"
}

### Save Promotion ID for Further Tests
@promotionId = <replace with actual promotion ID>

### 10. Update Promotion - Change Discount
PUT {{baseUrl}}/promotions/{{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discount_value": 30
}

### 11. Update Promotion - Extend End Date
PUT {{baseUrl}}/promotions/{{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(90, 'd') iso8601}}"
}

### 12. Update Promotion - Disable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/promotions/{{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 13. Delete Promotion
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/promotions/{{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Test Multiple Promotions
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions/applicable

### 15. Create Stack of Test Promotions
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "PROMO1",
  "discount_value": 10,
  "discount_type": "percentage",
  "start_date": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(7, 'd') iso8601}}",
  "is_active": true
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "PROMO2",
  "discount_value": 15,
  "discount_type": "percentage",
  "start_date": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "end_date": "{{$datetime offset(14, 'd') iso8601}}",
  "is_active": true
}

### 16. Validate Different Amounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "PROMO1",
  "total_amount": 200000
}

### 17. Test Minimum Purchase Requirement
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo_code": "FIXED100K",
  "total_amount": 400000
}
